      Data: 17|UnityEngine.TooltipAttribute, UnityEngine.CoreModule
    - Name: tooltip
      Entry: 1
      Data: 'Yaw correction for models whose nose is not built along +Z. Several
        of these fish are authored facing backwards, so steering them by their velocity
        points the tail the way they are travelling - set this to 180 for those.
        Verified per group by placing a camera on a fish''s own right: a correctly
        built model shows its nose on the right of frame.'
