      Data: 90|UnityEngine.TooltipAttribute, UnityEngine.CoreModule
    - Name: tooltip
      Entry: 1
      Data: 'Perlin wander alone leaves each fish parked on its slot: the seek direction
        flips every frame and the velocity smoothing averages it to nothing (measured
        0.02 m/s against a 0.45 m/s setting). Orbiting the whole school around its
        home keeps the target permanently moving, so the fish are always travelling
        somewhere. Radians per second.'
    - Name: 
